{
  "id": "458",
  "title": "Computer Virus",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-03-14",
  "synopsis": "Little He suspects that his computer has been infected with a computer virus.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/655/9c357617f21c0635d422070c81350b637ec45f93.mp3?1698351756",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "电脑中毒\n\n小何：小张，你能帮我看一下我的电脑吗？\n小张：怎么了？\n小何：我的电脑发不出邮件，可能是中毒了。\n小张：我看看。嗯……这个和电脑病毒没关系。你要发送的邮件太大了，超过了邮箱的容量。\n小何：哦，这样呀。那我应该怎么办？\n小张：你先压缩一下再发。",
    "traditional": "電腦中毒\n\n小何：小張，你能幫我看一下我的電腦嗎？\n小張：怎麼了？\n小何：我的電腦發不出郵件，可能是中毒了。\n小張：我看看。嗯……這個和電腦病毒沒關係。你要發送的郵件太大了，超過了郵箱的容量。\n小何：哦，這樣呀。那我應該怎麼辦？\n小張：你先壓縮一下再發。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Computer Virus"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：小张，你能帮我看一下我的电脑吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：小張，你能幫我看一下我的電腦嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé xiǎo zhāng nǐ néng bāng wǒ kàn yí xià wǒ de diàn nǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Little Zhang, can you help me take a look at my computer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小張：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：我的电脑发不出邮件，可能是中毒了。",
      "traditional": "小何：我的電腦發不出郵件，可能是中毒了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ de diàn nǎo fā bù chū yóu jiàn kě néng shì zhòng dú le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: My computer can't send emails. Perhaps it's been infected with a virus."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：我看看。嗯……这个和电脑病毒没关系。",
      "traditional": "小張：我看看。嗯……這個和電腦病毒沒關係。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ kàn kan èn zhè ge hé diàn nǎo bìng dú méi guān xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "你要发送的邮件太大了，超过了邮箱的容量。",
      "traditional": "你要發送的郵件太大了，超過了郵箱的容量。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ yào fā sòng de yóu jiàn tài dà le chāo guò le yóu xiāng de róng liàng",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I'll check. Hmm… This has nothing to do with computer viruses."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The email you're sending is too big, and exceeds the capacity of the mailbox."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小何：哦，这样呀。那我应该怎么办？",
      "traditional": "小何：哦，這樣呀。那我應該怎麼辦？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé ò zhè yàng ya nà wǒ yīng gāi zěn me bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Oh, I see. So what should I do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小张：你先压缩一下再发。",
      "traditional": "小張：你先壓縮一下再發。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nǐ xiān yā suō yí xià zài fā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: First compress it and then send it."
    }
  ],
